      <rules>
        <rule name="Enchanted Animal" id="cd6b-280-413d-df07" hidden="true">
          <description>The Rat Familiar earns experience as an henchman.


A result of 10 - 12 on the henchmen advancement table, instead of the promotion to hero status gives as a result


&quot;Improved spellcasting: if the sorcerer is within 6&quot; of the Rat Familiar, he gain a + 1 bonus when rolling dice to overcome the difficulty of a spell. This ability is cumulative.&quot;</description>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="eefe-8c87-e26c-4be9" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="82b4-271-c566-e580" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </rule>
      </rules>
